[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  1. \u001b[1mJ02\u001b[22m: the server decides who a script's command acts as under networked play. It is Tier 1 because the sender is\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     saved and replayed with every command.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mJ03 to J09, J30 and J35\u001b[30G\u001b[22min\u001b[33GTier\u001b[38G2:\u001b[41Gbehaviour\u001b[51Gtrees,\u001b[58Gscripts,\u001b[67Gpacks,\u001b[74Gpicking,\u001b[83Gphysics,\u001b[92Gsteering,\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[106Gway\u001b[110Gin\u001b[113Gto\u001b[116Ga\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   berth, the shell started through\u001b[39Ga sessio\u001b[48G, and dock\u001b[59Gcontrol s\u001b[69Gt by the\u001b[78Ggame. None has been aske\u001b[103G for yet.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   Manifest's later\u001b[23Gwork\u001b[28Gwaits\u001b[34Guntil\u001b[40Gyou've\u001b[47Gplayed\u001b[54Gits\u001b[58Gfirst\u001b[64Gloop\u001b[69Gfor\u001b[73Ga\u001b[75Gday\u001b[79Gor\u001b[82Gtwo.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mWait\u001b[8Gng on you:\u001b[22m keep or delete three unused pieces:\u001b[55G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mScene::ProxyFactory\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mEcs::StateMachine\u001b[39m,\u001b[95Gand the renderer's\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSetClusterRange\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSetShadowDistance\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe two separate tracks (J36–J50 and J51–J60)\u001b[49Garen't\u001b[56Gschedul\u001b[64Gd\u001b[66Guntil you place th\u001b[85Gm.\u001b[88G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Ganswered from t\u001b[21Ge roadmap alone.\u001b[38GI didn't read Manifest's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdelivery-order.md\u001b[39m to check whethe\u001b[97G it\u001b[101Gnow asks\u001b[110Gfor\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Banything\u001b[12Gahead\u001b[19Gf\u001b[21GJ01.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 12s · done 8:24 am\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m