[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat you'll need to sort out, once it's built:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m1. \u001b[1mKeep the server's secret key safe.\u001b[41G\u001b[22mIt's one file,\u001b[56Greadable \u001b[66Gnly by the s\u001b[79Grver's user (mod\u001b[96G 0600), and\u001b[108Gbacked up. If\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   you lose it, every cli\u001b[29Gnt has\u001b[36Gto be given \u001b[49Ghe new\u001b[56Gkey.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mDecide how players get the public key.\u001b[45G\u001b[22mEither\u001b[52Gship\u001b[57Git\u001b[60Gin\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gclient's\u001b[76Gconfig\u001b[83Gor\u001b[86Gbuild,\u001b[93Gor\u001b[96Gpublish\u001b[104Git\u001b[107Gsomewhere\u001b[117Gthey\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Btrust.\u001b[13GIf\u001b[16Gthat\u001b[21Gsomewhere\u001b[31Gis\u001b[34Gyour\u001b[39Gwebsite,\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gsite\u001b[57Gneeds\u001b[63GHTTPS.\u001b[70GA\u001b[72Gfree\u001b[77GLet's\u001b[83GEncrypt\u001b[91Gcertificate\u001b[103Gcovers\u001b[110Gthat,\u001b[116Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   it's separate from J01.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BPinned\u001b[10Gkeys\u001b[15Gcome with\u001b[25Gone trade-off: changi\u001b[47Gg the serv\u001b[58Gr's\u001b[62Gkey\u001b[66Gmeans\u001b[72Gupdating\u001b[81Gevery\u001b[87Gclient.\u001b[95GAvoiding\u001b[104Gthat\u001b[109Gwould\u001b[115Gneed\u001b[120Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsigning key that vouches for rotating server k\u001b[50Gys. That is\u001b[62G'\u001b[64G in th\u001b[71G plan a\u001b[79Gd isn't nee\u001b[91Ged now.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gchecked M\u001b[15Gnif\u001b[19Gst's D-\u001b[27G81\u001b[30G(libsodium,\u001b[42Gno\u001b[45GTLS\u001b[49Gover\u001b[54GUDP).\u001b[60GThe\u001b[64Gexact\u001b[70Ghandshake,\u001b[81Gand\u001b[85Gwhether\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gpinned\u001b[104Gkey\u001b[108Gships\u001b[114Gin\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbuild\u001b[9Gor\u001b[12Gin\u001b[15Gconfig,\u001b[23Garen't\u001b[30Gdesigned\u001b[39Gyet.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 21s · done 8:26 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mgo ahead and start J01. I have a website with SSL already taken care of. I think we should at least initially ship \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mthe key in a config file with the test builds.\u001b[39m                                                                        \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mTop\u001b[38;2;215;119;87msy-turvying… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Run /install-github-app to tag @claude in your GitHub issues and PRs\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0031 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
