u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m The consumer check passes as well. Next: clang-tidy on the changed files, then a look at what Manifest needs\u001b[112Gto\u001b[115Gadopt\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[45C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 4s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
