ommitted yet. Next, you choose whether to commit now and whether to run a Codex cross-review before Manifest adopts \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[23m\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mgive it four rounds of review or until it passes with no issues\u001b[39m                                                       \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✶\u001b[3GConcoctin\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mg…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Run \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/ultrareview\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m for a cloud-based multi-agent review that finds and verifies bugs in your branch — 3 free \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mreviews left\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
