[0.328, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mWe're delivering J01, connection encryption, and the engine side is built with the full gate green but nothing \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcommitted yet. Next, you choose whether to commit now and whether to run a Codex cross-review before Manifest adopts \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit. (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mgive it four rounds of review or until it passes with no issues\u001b[39m                                                       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands, recalled \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m memories \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(build/reviews/j01-brief.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m51\u001b[15G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[21Gto\u001b[24G\u001b[1mbuild/reviews/j01-brief.md\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m  1 \u001b[22m# J01: encryption in `net`\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m  2 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m  3 \u001b[22m**Roadmap row** (docs/roadmap.md\u001b[43Gbefore\u001b[50Gthis\u001b[55Gchange,\u001b[63Gnow\u001b[67Gin\u001b[70Gdocs/history/neutral-sdk.md#j01-encryption):\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  4 \u001b[22ma\u001b[12Gkey\u001b[16Gexchange\u001b[25Gin\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Ghello,\u001b[39Gwith\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Gserver's\u001b[57Gpublic\u001b[64Gkey\u001b[68Gpinned\u001b[75Gby\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gclient,\u001b[90Gthen\u001b[95Gevery\u001b[101Gpacket\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22msealed, on the libsodium `net` already links. A client with the wrong key is refused. The `net`\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22msuite\u001b[16Gand\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Gconsumer\u001b[33Gproject\u001b[41Grun\u001b[45Gsealed.\u001b[53GManifest's\u001b[64GD-081\u001b[70Gchose\u001b[76Glibsodium,\u001b[87Gnot\u001b[91GTLS\u001b[95G(no\u001b[99GTLS\u001b[103Gover\u001b[108GUDP).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m  7 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  8 \u001b[22m##\u001b[13GThe\u001b[17Gdesign\u001b[24G(source/engine/net/src/Seal.h,\u001b[55GSeal.cpp,\u001b[65GWire.*,\u001b[73GServer.cpp,\u001b[85GClient.cpp)\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m                          \u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
