[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G→ status and acces\u001b[22G. That's a\u001b[33Gchange to\u001b[43Gyour OpenAI\u001b[56Gccount, so\u001b[67Git's yours to\u001b[81Gr\u001b[83Gquest, not something I can do.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BPick\u001b[8Gone:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1. \u001b[1mRequest Daybreak access\u001b[22m, then I rerun the 4 rounds a\u001b[59G they are.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2. \u001b[1mTry another Codex model\u001b[22m,\u001b[31Gsu\u001b[35G as \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--model gpt-6.1-sol\u001b[39m. I\u001b[62Gs\u001b[64Gfilter may judge\u001b[81Gdiff\u001b[86Grently,\u001b[94Gbut \u001b[100Gat's a guess,\u001b[114Gand\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Beach\u001b[11Gfailed\u001b[18Gtry\u001b[22Gcosts\u001b[28Gtokens.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3. \u001b[1mSoften the opening line of \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mscripts/cross-review-prompt.md\u001b[64G\u001b[22m\u001b[39mfor\u001b[68Gthis\u001b[73Greview\u001b[80Gonly,\u001b[86Gfor\u001b[90Gexample\u001b[98Gto\u001b[101G\"correctness\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Greviewer\". That changes a shared scrip\u001b[45G, so\u001b[50GI'd want your OK first.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4\u001b[6G\u001b[1mReview with\u001b[18Ga Claude agent instead\u001b[22m: same brief, same 4-round limit, but not the Codex review your workflow n\u001b[115Gmes.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'd go with 1 if you can get access quickly, otherwise 4.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe code is still uncommitted. To let the review script\u001b[59Gsnapshot the working \u001b[81Gree,\u001b[86GI'v\u001b[90G staged the four new files\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mKey.h\u001b[39m,\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mKey.cpp\u001b[39m,\u001b[20G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSeal.h\u001b[39m,\u001b[28G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSeal.cpp\u001b[39m).\u001b[39GThe\u001b[43Grest\u001b[48Gis\u001b[51Gunstaged,\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Ggate\u001b[74Gresult\u001b[81Gfrom\u001b[86Gbefore\u001b[93Gstill\u001b[99Gholds.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 7m 44s · done 9:01 am\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m1. Not an option, I am a solo indie dev.\u001b[39m                                                                              \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m3. Do this but also stress that this is a simulation game I am developing. Explain why we need to review the code.\u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3GBrewing… \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0031 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
