[0.069, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI\u001b[5Gchanged the review prompt's opening to frame this as a solo developer's game and to stress careful reading of\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btoken-encryption change, and I'll restore it afterwards. Round 1 is now running.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mKeep the lines that stress it is a simulation game built by a solo developer. They stay when you revert the other \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mlines.\u001b[39m                                                                                                                \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNoted.\u001b[10GWhen\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Greview\u001b[26Gends\u001b[31GI'll\u001b[36Gkeep\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Glines\u001b[51Gsaying\u001b[58Git's\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65Gsimulation\u001b[76Ggame\u001b[81Gbuilt\u001b[87Gby\u001b[90Ga\u001b[92Gsolo\u001b[97Gdeveloper,\u001b[108Gand\u001b[112Grevert\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gthe oth\u001b[11Gr\u001b[13Glines.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mI also want you to ask the reviewer to be more thorough. It's taking 3+ rounds each time to find unrelated errors. It\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mshould try harder on each round than it currently is.\u001b[39m                                                             \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI've\u001b[8Gnoted\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Ginstruction:\u001b[31Gfrom\u001b[36Ground\u001b[42G2\u001b[44Gon,\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Greview\u001b[59Gwill\u001b[64Gcover\u001b[70Geverything\u001b[81Gin\u001b[84Gone\u001b[88Gpass,\u001b[94Gread\u001b[99Gwhole\u001b[105Gfiles\u001b[111Gand\u001b[115Gtheir\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gcallers, a\u001b[14Gd r\u001b[18G-check the whole change in\u001b[46Gat\u001b[49Gr\u001b[51Grounds. I can't edit the\u001b[76Gtre\u001b[81Gd\u001b[83Gring round 1 because the\u001b[108Gscript\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdiscards revi\u001b[17Gws\u001b[20Gwhere\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Gtree\u001b[35Gchanged.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[2B●\u001b[39m Reading bq4d42uh7\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  /tmp/claude-1000/-home-ivan-projects-jettison/63ca4306-0c79-4ae2-80b5-693de305cf10/tasks/bq4d42uh7.output\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[63C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 5s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
