es and\u001b[115Gtheir\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcalle\u001b[9Gs,\u001b[12Gand re-check the whol\u001b[41G in later rounds.\u001b[59GI\u001b[61Gcan't\u001b[67Gedit\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gtree\u001b[81Gduring\u001b[88Ground\u001b[94G1\u001b[96Gbecause\u001b[104Gthe\u001b[108Gscript\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdiscards\u001b[12Greviews\u001b[20Gwhere\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Gtree\u001b[35Gchanged.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;107;128m●\u001b[39m Background command \"Run cross-review round 1\" failed with exit code 1\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
