[0.051, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H     \u001b[2m 32 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 33 \u001b[22m - `CLAUDE.md` (how the \u001b[35Groject\u001b[42Gworks;\u001b[49Git\u001b[52Gapplies\u001b[60Gto\u001b[63Gyou\u001b[67Gas\u001b[70Gmuch\u001b[75Gas\u001b[78Gto\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gauthor).\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(build/reviews/j01-reply-1.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m41\u001b[15G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[21Gto\u001b[24G\u001b[1mbuild/reviews/j01-reply-1.md\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m  1 \u001b[22m#\u001b[12GReply to\u001b[21Ground 1\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  2 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m  3 \u001b[22mAll\u001b[14Gfour findings are accepted and fixed. Each new test was checked\u001b[78Gagainst\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Gmutation\u001b[97Gthat\u001b[102Gundoes\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m  4 \u001b[22mits\u001b[14Gfix: the test fails with the mutation\u001b[52Gand\u001b[56Gpasses\u001b[63Gwithout\u001b[71Git.\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22m## F1: counter exhaustion — fixed\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m  7 \u001b[22m`Keys::Seal` is `[[nodiscard]] bool` and refuses,\u001b[60Gwriting\u001b[68Gnothing,\u001b[77Gonce\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Gcount\u001b[92Greaches\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m  8 \u001b[22m`kSpentCounter`\u001b[26G(UINT64_MAX),\u001b[40Gwhich\u001b[46Gis\u001b[49Gnever\u001b[55Gsent;\u001b[61G`Open`\u001b[68Grefuses\u001b[76Gthat\u001b[81Gcounter,\u001b[90Gso\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m`m_l\u001b[15GastR\u001b[20Gceived` is at most\u001b[39GUINT64_MAX\u001b[50Gand\u001b[54Gcannot\u001b[61Gwrap.\u001b[67G`Wire::MakePacket`\u001b[86Greturns\u001b[94Gnull\u001b[99Gwhen\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22msealing is refused, so `Send` returns false and the welcome or hello path closes as before.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +31 lines \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cmake --build build/consumer 2>&1 | rg -n \"error|FAILED\" | head; ctest --test-dir build/consumer 2>&1 | tail -3\r\u001b[12C\u001b[2B11m\u001b[17G25s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m21.1k\u001b[31Gtokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
