cts\u001b[39m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCCACHE_BASEDIR\u001b[39m), so a worktree made there would s\u001b[95Gare nothing.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GWorktrunk mak\u001b[19Gs\u001b[21Ga n\u001b[25Gw\u001b[27Gworktree for each branch and remove\u001b[63G it\u001b[67Gon me\u001b[73Gg\u001b[75G. Ev\u001b[80Gry b\u001b[85Ganch would start w\u001b[104Gth empty\u001b[113Gbuild\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtrees: about five\u001b[23Gcold builds per gate,\u001b[45Gand Debug builds never share objects between\u001b[90Gtrees\u001b[96Ganyway.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mProposal: three permanent lanes, reused from task to task.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m1. \u001b[1mLanes\u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m~/projects/jettison\u001b[39m (this checkout) plus \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m~/projects/jettison.lane-b\u001b[81G\u001b[39mand\u001b[85G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m~/projects/jettison.lane-c\u001b[39m,\u001b[113Gmade\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gonce with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgit worktree add\u001b[33G\u001b[39mand never removed. A\u001b[54Gnew task does \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mg\u001b[70Gt switch -c <task> main\u001b[39m inside a free lane, so that\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Blan\u001b[10G's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild/\u001b[39m trees, Debug\u001b[33Go\u001b[35Ges includ\u001b[45Gd, stay warm. Each lane costs about 14 GB of disk, an\u001b[99G 281 GB is free. They\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bsit under \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m~/projects\u001b[39m, so the ccache shari\u001b[76Gended.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
