[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mmade once with \u001b[48;2;2;40;0m`git worktree\u001b[41Gadd --detach build/gate-tree <commit>`. For each c\u001b[92Gmmit gated, run\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 177 \u001b[22m `git -C build/gate-tree checkout --detach <commit>`, then `build/gate-tree/scripts/ci.sh` with the\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[12G\u001b[22mgate's opt\u001b[23Gons. While it runs nothing else builds, runs tests or runs clang-tidy (the user's rule,\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[12G\u001b[22m2026-11-21), \u001b[26Go\u001b[28Gt\u001b[30Ge work\u001b[37Gbeside it is\u001b[51Gditing alone. A failure is fixed by a later commit, befor\u001b[109G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G./scripts/ci.sh\u001b[27G--werror\u001b[36G--asan\u001b[43G--log\u001b[49Gbuild/gate.…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --log build/gate.log 2>&1 | tail -4\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
