[0.053, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  Round 4 sti\u001b[15Gl said \"changes\" for two small items, a literal channel\u001b[71Gcount\u001b[77Gand\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83Gcomment's\u001b[93Gwording.\u001b[102GI\u001b[104Gfixed\u001b[110Gboth\u001b[115Gafter\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe round, so no\u001b[20Greviewer\u001b[29Ghas\u001b[33Gseen\u001b[38Gthose\u001b[44Gtwo\u001b[48Gfixes.\u001b[55GThe\u001b[59Ggate\u001b[64Gpasses\u001b[71Gafter\u001b[77Gthem.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mReview prompt:\u001b[22m it n\u001b[23Gw\u001b[25Gsays the engine is a solo develop\u001b[59Gr's simulation game and asks for thoroughness\u001b[105Gevery\u001b[111Ground.\u001b[118GIt\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Breads\u001b[9Gall\u001b[13Gtouched\u001b[21Gfiles\u001b[27Gin\u001b[30Gfull,\u001b[36Gchases\u001b[43Grepeated\u001b[52Gmistakes,\u001b[62Gre-reviews\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gwhole\u001b[83Gchange\u001b[90Geach\u001b[95Ground\u001b[101Gand\u001b[105Gholds\u001b[111Gnothing\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bback. The J01-only wording\u001b[30Gis\u001b[33Greverted.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mLanes\u001b[22m (committed in both\u001b[28Grepositories,\u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m4b2707d\u001b[50G\u001b[39mand\u001b[54GManifest's\u001b[65G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m723e8d5\u001b[39m):\r\u001b[1B  - \u001b[1mWorktrees:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m~/projects/jettison.lane-b\u001b[43G\u001b[39mand\u001b[47G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.lane-c\u001b[39m,\u001b[56Gplus\u001b[61G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest.lane-b\u001b[77G\u001b[39mand\u001b[81G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.lane-c\u001b[39m,\u001b[90Gkept\u001b[95Gbetween\u001b[103Gtasks.\u001b[110GA\u001b[112Gtask\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bstarts with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgit switch -c <task> feature-base\u001b[51G\u001b[39mand\u001b[55Gmerges\u001b[62Gback\u001b[67Ginto\u001b[72G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mShared lock:\u001b[18G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mscripts/heavy.sh\u001b[35G\u001