[0.130, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWorktrunk path:\u001b[22m I changed it in your dotfiles (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m~/.dotfiles/.config/worktrunk/config.toml\u001b[39m) to\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m~/projects/<repo>.<branch>\u001b[39m, so any worktree i\u001b[51G makes shares\u001b[65Gccache.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWarm builds:\u001b[22m engine\u001b[25Glanes\u001b[31GB\u001b[33Gand\u001b[37GC\u001b[39Geach\u001b[44Gran\u001b[48Ga\u001b[50Gfull\u001b[55Gcold\u001b[60Ggate\u001b[65Gand\u001b[69Gboth\u001b[74Gpassed,\u001b[82Gin\u001b[85Gabout\u001b[91G18\u001b[94Gminutes\u001b[102Geach,\u001b[108Gso\u001b[111Gtheir\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbuild trees are warm. Manifest's\u001b[38Glanes are p\u001b[50Grked\u001b[55Gon \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[71G\u001b[39mbut no\u001b[78G built,\u001b[86Gso\u001b[89Gtheir\u001b[95Gfirst\u001b[101Gbuild\u001b[107Gwill\u001b[112Gbe\u001b[115Gcold.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GManifest's lane\u001b[21Gchange was only\u001b[37Gsyntax-checked, not run through its gate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mLane state:\u001b[22m each lane has a\u001b[33G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild/lane.md\u001b[39m saying what it holds.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOne risk:\u001b[22m a proc\u001b[20Gss left running by \u001b[40G killed\u001b[48Gg\u001b[50Gte, such as a stray Xvfb, keeps the\u001b[86Gl\u001b[88Gck until it exits.\u001b[107G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mheavy.sh\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprints that it's waiting, so\u001b[32Ga stuck queue shows up.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext:\u001b[9G\u001b[22mManifest's\u001b[20Gadoption\u001b[29Gof\u001b[32GJ01\u001b[36G(the\u001b[41Gserver\u001b[48Gkey\u001b[52Gfile,\u001b[58G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--key\u001b[39m,\u001b[65Gand\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Gpublic\u001b[80Gkey\u001b[84Gin\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gtest\u001b[96Gbuilds'\u001