[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3Gprints that it's waiting, so a stuck\u001b[40Gqueue shows\u001b[52Gup.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext:\u001b[22m Manif\u001b[16Gt's adoption of J01 (the server\u001b[48Gkey file,\u001b[58G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--key\u001b[39m, and the public key in the test builds' client config),\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bin lane A. I'd use Opus at high effor\u001b[41G, becaus\u001b[50G it's t\u001b[59Gst-boundary and file-permission\u001b[91Gwork.\u001b[97GNow\u001b[101Gis\u001b[104Ga\u001b[106Ggood\u001b[111Gpoint\u001b[117Gto\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GSautéed for 1h 22m 14s · done 10:26 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mLet's revise the way the worktrees will be used. I see there are six total now, including the ones that are provided \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mby the primary source code folder i.e. ~/projects/jettison and ~/projects/manifest . I want the primary one to be \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mused for merging in work from the two secondary worktrees for each project. You will continue to orchestrate from the\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mprimary folders. Keep the mechanisms you proposed for determining which worktree to use when a new task is started. \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mAnd gate the really heavy tasks like the full gate and clang builds as you do now.\u001b[39m                                    \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThis will give me a clean worktree for merging into, one for work that is written and is being tested by the gate, \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mand the last one will allow us to being on the next task without interfering with the gate.\u001b[39m                           \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mPlanning for each task should do a little pre-thinking about the likelihood of the work clashing with changes in \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mprogress on another worktree and warn me ahead of beginning that work.\u001b[39m                                                \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3GFermenting… \u001b[16G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0031 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
