[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mLet's revise the way the worktrees will be used. I see there are six total now, including the ones that are provided \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mby the primary source code folder i.e. ~/projects/jettison and ~/projects/manifest . I want the primary one to be \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mused for merging\u001b[20Gin work\u001b[28Gfrom th\u001b[36G t\u001b[39Go secondary worktrees for each project. You\u001b[83Gwil\u001b[87G co\u001b[91Gtinu\u001b[97Gto orc\u001b[104Gestrate from the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprimary folders. Keep\u001b[25Gthe mechanisms you \u001b[47Gposed for determining which worktre\u001b[83G \u001b[85Go use when a new t\u001b[104Gsk\u001b[107Gis s\u001b[112Gart\u001b[116Gd. \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAnd gate\u001b[12Gthe really\u001b[23Gheavy tasks like th\u001b[43G full gate and clang builds as you do no\u001b[84G.\u001b[39m                                   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                                                    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThis will give me a\u001b[23Gclean\u001b[29Gwor\u001b[33Gtree for merging into, one for\u001b[64Gwork th\u001b[72Gt\u001b[74Gis written and is being tested by the gate, \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band the last one will allow us to being on the next task without interfering with the gate.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m                                                                                                                   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mPlanning for\u001b[16Geach task sh\u001b[29Guld do a l\u001b[40Gttle pre-thinking abou\u001b[63G the\u001b[68Glik\u001b[72Glihood of \u001b[84Ge work clashing with changes in \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprogress on another worktree and warn me ahead of beginning that work.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────────────────────────── 2 new messages ────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m I'll make this change the new way: in lane B, merged into the primary afterwards. First, reading the current lane docs\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthere.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
