u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mChoosing a lane:\u001b[22m the \u001b[27Gew \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mscripts/lan\u001b[42Gs.sh\u001b[39m lists all six\u001b[61Gworktrees. For each it shows the branch, how far it is\u001b[116Gfrom\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m, the files\u001b[29Gits\u001b[33Gwork\u001b[38Gchanges\u001b[46Gand\u001b[50Gits\u001b[54Gnote\u001b[59Gfrom\u001b[64G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild/lane.md\u001b[39m.\u001b[79GA\u001b[81Gfree\u001b[86Glane\u001b[91Gis\u001b[94Gone\u001b[98Gparked\u001b[105Gon\u001b[108G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mwith\u001b[10Gno\u001b[13Gchanges.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mClash warnings:\u001b[22m before starting a task, I'll list the files\u001b[65Gand modules i\u001b[79G will change and compare\u001b[104Gthem\u001b[109Gwith\u001b[114Gwhat\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlan\u001b[10G.sh\u001b[39m shows for the other lanes, \u001b[42Gn\u001b[44Gboth repositories. If they overlap on a\u001b[84Gfile, a module o\u001b[101G a public header,\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  I'll \u001b[11Gell you before starting and say how\u001b[47GI'd resolv\u001b[59Git. The roadmap, history and decisions docs\u001b[103Gar\u001b[107Gedited by most\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  tasks,\u001b[12Gso\u001b[15Gclashes\u001b[23Gthere\u001b[29Gare\u001b[33Gexpected\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Gget\u001b[50Gresolved\u001b[59Gat\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Gmerge.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mHeavy work\u001b[16G\u001b[22mis\u001b[19Gunchanged:\u001b[30G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mci.sh\u001b[36G\u001b[39mand\u001b[40G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mheavy.sh\u001b[49G\u001b[39mstill\u001b[55Gshare\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gone\u001b[69Glock,\u001b[75Gso\u001b[78Ggates\u001b[84Gand\u001b[88Gclang\u001b[94Gbuilds\u001b[101Gtake\u001b[106Gturns.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
