[0.099, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe docs (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild-and-gates.md\u001b[39m in both\u001b[40Grepositories, Jettison's\u001b[65G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAGENTS.md\u001b[39m) and my memory notes are updated to match.\u001b[118GAll\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfour\u001b[8Glanes\u001b[14Gare\u001b[18Gparked\u001b[25Gon\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gcurrent\u001b[40G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m.\u001b[54GEngine\u001b[61Glanes\u001b[67GB\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73GC\u001b[75Ghave\u001b[80Gwarm\u001b[85Gbuild\u001b[91Gtrees;\u001b[98GManifest's\u001b[109Glanes\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhaven't been built yet.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mClash check for the next task\u001b[22m,\u001b[34GManifest\u001b[43Gadopting\u001b[52GJ01:\u001b[57Git\u001b[60Gwill\u001b[65Gtouch\u001b[71GManifest's\u001b[82G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mremote\u001b[89G\u001b[39mmodule,\u001b[97Gits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest\u001b[39m/\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest-token\u001b[27G\u001b[39mapps,\u001b[33Gits\u001b[37Gconfig\u001b[44Gand\u001b[48Gits\u001b[52Gdocs.\u001b[58GNo\u001b[61Gother\u001b[67Glane\u001b[72Ghas\u001b[76Gwork\u001b[81Gin\u001b[84Gprogress,\u001b[94Gso\u001b[97Gthere's\u001b[105Gnothing\u001b[113Gto\u001b[116Gclash\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwith. It would go in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest.lane-b\u001b[39m, built against the engine's pin moved \u001b[79Go \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mea\u001b[84G405b\u001b[89G\u001b[39mor later. I'd\u001b[103Guse\u001b[107GOpus\u001b[112Gat\u001b[115Ghigh\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Beffort.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 3m 47s · done 10:32 am\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mcommit and push, then advise if it's safe to /clear\u001b[39m                                                                   \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell c