[0.015, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3GThe\u001b[7Gdocs\u001b[12G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild-and-gates.md\u001b[32G\u001b[39min\u001b[35Gboth\u001b[40Grepositories,\u001b[54GJettison's\u001b[65G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAGENTS.md\u001b[39m)\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Gmy\u001b[83Gmemory\u001b[90Gnotes\u001b[96Gare\u001b[100Gupdated\u001b[108Gto\u001b[111Gmatch.\u001b[118GAll\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfour lanes are parked on the\u001b[32Gcurrent\u001b[40G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m.\u001b[54GEngine lanes B and C h\u001b[77Gve\u001b[80Gwar\u001b[84G build tr\u001b[94Ges; Manifest's lanes\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhaven't been built yet.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mClash check for the next task\u001b[22m,\u001b[34GManifest\u001b[43Gadopting\u001b[52GJ01:\u001b[57Git\u001b[60Gwill\u001b[65Gtouch\u001b[71GManifest's\u001b[82G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mremote\u001b[89G\u001b[39mmodule,\u001b[97Gits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest\u001b[39m/\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest-token\u001b[39m apps, its config and \u001b[49Gts\u001b[52Gdocs. No other lane has work in progress, so\u001b[97Gthere's\u001b[105Gnothing\u001b[113Gto\u001b[116Gclash\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwith. It would go in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest.lane-b\u001b[39m, built against the engin\u001b[65G's pin\u001b[72Gmoved to\u001b[81G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249meae405b\u001b[39m or later. I'd use Opus a\u001b[114G high\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Beffort.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 3m 47s · done 10:32 am\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mcommit and push, then advise if it's safe to /clear\u001b[39m                                                                   \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command, recalled \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m memory \r\u00