directory, through the engin\u001b[35G's dur\u001b[42Gble writ\u001b[51Gs) beside\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gtokens\u001b[72Gfile,\u001b[78Gby\u001b[81Gdefault\u001b[89Gunder\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[7G$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/manifes\u001b[32G/`, and p\u001b[42Gints th\u001b[50G public key\u001b[62Gonce. Refuses to overwrite\u001b[89Gan existing\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bkey unless\u001b[17Gasked. \u001b[25G   \u001b[29G        \u001b[38G       \u001b[46G       \u001b[54G      \u001b[61G   \u001b[65G      \u001b[72G     \u001b[78G  \u001b[81G       \u001b[89G     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[7Gmanifest --serve` reads \u001b[32Ghat\u001b[36Gsecret key\u001b[47Gfile, with\u001b[58Ga `--key <file>` opti\u001b[80Gn, and fails clearly\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bif it is mis\u001b[19Ging or\u001b[26Gmalformed\u001b[36G(as\u001b[40G`cli_serve_missing_tokens`\u001b[67Gdoes\u001b[72Gfor\u001b[76Gtokens).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6GThe client side (\u001b[24GRemote::Client`, \u001b[42Ghe console's `connect <host:port> <\u001b[78Goken>`) takes the     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bserver'\u001b[15Gpubl\u001b[20Gc key\u001b[26Gfrom a config\u001b[40Gfi\u001b[43Ge. The user wants t\u001b[63Gst builds to\u001b[76Gship the\u001b[85Gkey\u001b[89Gin\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gconfig\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gfile. Propo\u001b[18Ge where it lives a\u001b[37Gd its format b\u001b[52Gfore writing it.       \u001b[76G         \u001b[86G     \u001b[92G   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6GMove the\u001b[16Gin to\u001b[22G`24bd3ec` (an SDK\u001b[40Gchange, with the dev\u001b[61Gshell if it\u001b[73Gchanged).  \u001b[85G   \u001b[89G  \u001b[92G \u001b[94G      \u001b[49m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
