[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;38;79;120mbr\u001b[8Gaks Ma\u001b[15Gifest's s\u001b[25Grv\u001b[28Gr and client until they supply\u001b[59Gkeys.                 \u001b[82G \u001b[84G      \u001b[91G    \u001b[96G  \u001b[99G    \r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B  \u001b[8G \u001b[10G      \u001b[17G    \u001b[22G  \u001b[25G      \u001b[32G    \u001b[37G      \u001b[44G                       \u001b[68G  \u001b[71G             \u001b[85G  \u001b[88G      \u001b[95G   \u001b[99G   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B## The task        \u001b[23G      \u001b[30G   \u001b[34G      \u001b[41G     \u001b[47G    \u001b[52G      \u001b[59G     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIn\u001b[6GManifest,\u001b[16Gbuilt\u001b[22Gagainst\u001b[30Gthe\u001b[34Gengine\u001b[41Gat\u001b[44G`24bd3ec`:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G`manifest-token\u001b[22Gkey`:\u001b[28Gwrites\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Gserver's\u001b[48Gsecret\u001b[55Gkey\u001b[59Gto\u001b[62Ga\u001b[64Gprivate\u001b[72Gfile\u001b[77G(0600,\u001b[84Gin\u001b[87Ga\u001b[89G0700\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gdirectory, through the engin\u001b[35G's dur\u001b[42Gble writ\u001b[51Gs) beside\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gtokens\u001b[72Gfile,\u001b[78Gby\u001b[81Gdefault\u001b[89Gunder\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[7G$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/manifes\u001b[32G/`, and p\u001b[42Gints th\u001b[50G public key\u001b[62Gonce. Refuses to overwrite\u001b[89Gan existing\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bkey unless\u001b[17Gasked. \u001b[25G   \u001b[29G        \u001b[38G       \u001b[46G       \u001b[54G      \u001b[61G   \u001b[65G      \u001b[72G     \u001b[78G  \u001b[81G       \u001b[89G     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[7Gmanifest --serve` reads \u001b[32Ghat\u001b[36Gsecret key\u001b[47Gfile, with\u001b[58Ga `--key <file>` opti\u001b[80Gn, and fails clearly\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bif it is mis\u001b[19Ging or\u001b[26Gmalformed\u001b[36G(as\u001b[40G`cli_serve_missing_tokens`\u001b[67Gdoes\u001b[72Gfor\u001b[76Gtokens).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6GThe client side (\u001b[24GRemote::Client`, \u001b[42Ghe console's `connect <host:port> <\u001b[78Goken>`) takes the     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bserver'\u001b[15Gpubl\u001b[20Gc key\u001b[26Gfrom a config\u001b[40Gfi\u001b[43Ge. The user wants t\u001b[63Gst builds to\u001b[76Gship the\u001b[85Gkey\u001b[89Gin\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gconfig\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gfile. Propo\u001b[18Ge where it lives a\u001b[37Gd its format b\u001b[52Gfore writing it.       \u001b[76G         \u001b[86G     \u001b[92G   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6GMove the\u001b[16Gin to\u001b[22G`24bd3ec` (an SDK\u001b[40Gchange, with the dev\u001b[61Gshell if it\u001b[73Gchanged).  \u001b[85G   \u001b[89G  \u001b[92G \u001b[94G      \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B5.\u001b[6GDocs:\u001b[12GD-081 (no longer\u001b[29Gplaintext), `server.md` (\"Connections are\u001b[71Gplaintext\"\u001b[82Gsection,\u001b[91Gusage\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gexamples), `sc\u001b[21Gpe.md`, `roadmap.md`, `d\u001b[46Glivery-order.md` L01. All five still\u001b[83Glink\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G`../../jettison/d\u001b[24Gcs/\u001b[28Goadmap.md#j01\u001b[42G, which no\u001b[53Glonger ex\u001b[63Gst\u001b[66G; point them at\u001b[82G        \u001b[91G     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B`../../jetti\u001b[19Gon/docs/hist\u001b[32Gry/neutral-s\u001b[45Gk.md#j01-enc\u001b[58Gyption` or the networking doc.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B6.\u001b[6GTests: the `remote` suite \u001b[33Gnd the CLI\u001b[44Gsmoke\u001b[50Gtests (`cli_serve`, `serve-smoke.sh`)\u001b[88Grun\u001b[92Gsealed.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BAdd a case for a mi\u001b[26Gsing \u001b[33G malfo\u001b[40Gmed key file and for a client pin\u001b[75Gd to the\u001b[84Gwrong\u001b[90Gkey\u001b[49m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
