[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;38;79;120m  \u001b[7G$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/manifes\u001b[32G/`, and p\u001b[42Gints th\u001b[50G public key\u001b[62Gonce. Refuses to overwrite\u001b[89Gan existing\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bkey unless\u001b[17Gasked. \u001b[25G   \u001b[29G        \u001b[38G       \u001b[46G       \u001b[54G      \u001b[61G   \u001b[65G      \u001b[72G     \u001b[78G  \u001b[81G       \u001b[89G     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[7Gmanifest --serve` reads \u001b[32Ghat\u001b[36Gsecret key\u001b[47Gfile, with\u001b[58Ga `--key <file>` opti\u001b[80Gn, and fails clearly\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bif it is mis\u001b[19Ging or\u001b[26Gmalformed\u001b[36G(as\u001b[40G`cli_serve_missing_tokens`\u001b[67Gdoes\u001b[72Gfor\u001b[76Gtokens).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6GThe client side (\u001b[24GRemote::Client`, \u001b[42Ghe console's `connect <host:port> <\u001b[78Goken>`) takes the     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bserver'\u001b[15Gpubl\u001b[20Gc key\u001b[26Gfrom a config\u001b[40Gfi\u001b[43Ge. The user wants t\u001b[63Gst builds to\u001b[76Gship the\u001b[85Gkey\u001b[89Gin\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gconfig\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gfile. Propo\u001b[18Ge where it lives a\u001b[37Gd its format b\u001b[52Gfore writing it.       \u001b[76G         \u001b[86G     \u001b[92G   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6GMove the\u001b[16Gin to\u001b[22G`24bd3ec` (an SDK\u001b[40Gchange, with the dev\u001b[61Gshell if it\u001b[73Gchanged).  \u001b[85G   \u001b[89G  \u001b[92G \u001b[94G      \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B5.\u001b[6GDocs:\u001b[12GD-081 (no longer\u001b[29Gplaintext), `server.md` (\"Connections are\u001b[71Gplaintext\"\u001b[82Gsection,\u001b[91Gusage\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gexamples), `sc\u001b[21Gpe.md`, `roadmap.md`, `d\u001b[46Glivery-order.md` L01. All five still\u001b[83Glink\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G`../../jettison/d\u001b[24Gcs/\u001b[28Goadmap.md#j01\u001b[42G, which no\u001b[53Glonger ex\u001b[63Gst\u001b[66G; point them at\u001b[82G        \u001b[91G     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B`../../jetti\u001b[19Gon/docs/hist\u001b[32Gry/neutral-s\u001b[45Gk.md#j01-enc\u001b[58Gyption` or the networking doc.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B6.\u001b[6GTests: the `remote` suite \u001b[33Gnd the CLI\u001b[44Gsmoke\u001b[50Gtests (`cli_serve`, `serve-smoke.sh`)\u001b[88Grun\u001b[92Gsealed.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BAdd a case for a mi\u001b[26Gsing \u001b[33G malfo\u001b[40Gmed key file and for a client pin\u001b[75Gd to the\u001b[84Gwrong\u001b[90Gkey\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G(`KeyMismatch`).   \u001b[26G     \u001b[32G   \u001b[36G   \u001b[40G   \u001b[44G     \u001b[50G     \u001b[56G             \u001b[70G                 \u001b[88G   \u001b[92G       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B   \u001b[10G \u001b[12G    \u001b[17G   \u001b[21G \u001b[23G       \u001b[31G  \u001b[34G         \u001b[44G   \u001b[48G    \u001b[53G   \u001b[57G   \u001b[61G \u001b[63G      \u001b[70G      \u001b[77G  \u001b[80G   \u001b[84G     \u001b[90G   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B##\u001b[6GHow to work (the\u001b[23Guser's\u001b[30Grules,\u001b[37Gall\u001b[41Gin\u001b[44Gmemory\u001b[51Gand\u001b[55Gdocs)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GLanes\u001b[11G(Jettison\u001b[21G`docs/build-and-gates.md#lanes`):\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Gprimary\u001b[67Gcheckouts\u001b[77G`~/projects/jettison`\u001b[99Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  `~/projects/manifest` stay clean on\u001b[41G`feature-b\u001b[52Gse`, for\u001b[61Gmerges\u001b[68Gand\u001b[72Gorchestration\u001b[86Gonly.\u001b[92GDo\u001b[95Gthis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gt\u001b[7Gsk in `~/pr\u001b[19Gjects/manifest.lane-b` with `git swi\u001b[56Gch\u001b[59G-c <task> feat\u001b[74Gre-base`, then m\u001b[91Grge back   \u001b[49m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
